# comments, statement ends, soft keywords and operator glyphs as wiki/comments.md, wiki/keyword.md and wiki/operator.md say (decisions hash-comments, P165, P172, unicode-symbols, operator-alias)
'3 # a comment'	3
's = "abc"; #s'	3
'7 // 2'	7
'print 1    print 2'	error
'match = 3; match + 1'	4
'fire(x) := x * 2; fire 3'	6
'3 ⇔ 4'	error
'3 × 4'	12
'√16'	4
